        <key>construction</key>
        <string>Keep the genuine lowercase loop, counter and terminal cuts. Bring loop and inner fork to the normal round baseline in the native italic axis, then draw the new straight joins to the unchanged upper terminals. This is distinct from a descending gamma or the O-y digraph; no whole glyph scaling or synthetic italic.</string>
